{"3545360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AquaBall League", "steam_appid": 3545360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4829850], "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to play your friends in AquaBall?  You got next!  Get special rewards for your pre-purchase.  We will send you the crowdfunding information also.  Cheers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545360/extras/38d427fca973a6811d08203c76fdc145.avif?t=1782347290\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the AquaBall League (ABL) The Ultimate Ocean Showdown! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete, explore, and complete epic quests to protect the seas, unlock power-ups, and become an AquaBall legend! Are you ready to dive in? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, in the crystal-clear waters of JamRock Bay, a young islander named Jay and his adventurous best friend, Odon the dolphin, dreamed of bringing the oceans fastest, smartest, and most agile creatures together for an electrifying new sport. With the help of their dolphin pod and a crew of marine champions, they created AquaBall League a high-speed, high-energy water sport where teamwork, skill, and oceanic instincts collide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the AquaBall League is a global sensation, with teams from every corner of the seven seas competing in 2v2 matches, using their natural abilities dolphin flips, octopus tentacle passes, squid ink defense, and more to score epic goals. Players train all year long for a chance to compete in the legendary annual playoffs, leading up to the most prestigious event of all:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(AquaBall League Championships) THE OCEAN BOWL CHAMPIONSHIPS </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Held in the breathtaking Arenas of Atlantis Prime, the Ocean Bowl is where only the best of the best battle for the Aqua Crown! From the mystical Shadalar Gardens to the treacherous waves of Poseidons Horn, every match is a test of speed, precision, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AquaBall League exposes our audience and community, to concepts of being eco-friendly citizens, promoting conservation, and creativity. In between matches, players embark on quests to clean up arenas, solve oceanic mysteries, and build new technology to protect marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, are you ready to dive in, make history, and become an AquaBall legend? The next Ocean Bowl is calling will you answer?  You got next!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAX EAST 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We travelled to Boston to share the journey with our Fandom Demo version.  Check out the highlights and feedback:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To our Wishlist:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545360/extras/38d427fca973a6811d08203c76fdc145.avif?t=1782347290\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the AquaBall League (ABL) The Ultimate Ocean Showdown! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete, explore, and complete epic quests to protect the seas, unlock power-ups, and become an AquaBall legend! Are you ready to dive in? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, in the crystal-clear waters of JamRock Bay, a young islander named Jay and his adventurous best friend, Odon the dolphin, dreamed of bringing the oceans fastest, smartest, and most agile creatures together for an electrifying new sport. With the help of their dolphin pod and a crew of marine champions, they created AquaBall League a high-speed, high-energy water sport where teamwork, skill, and oceanic instincts collide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the AquaBall League is a global sensation, with teams from every corner of the seven seas competing in 2v2 matches, using their natural abilities dolphin flips, octopus tentacle passes, squid ink defense, and more to score epic goals. Players train all year long for a chance to compete in the legendary annual playoffs, leading up to the most prestigious event of all:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(AquaBall League Championships) THE OCEAN BOWL CHAMPIONSHIPS </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Held in the breathtaking Arenas of Atlantis Prime, the Ocean Bowl is where only the best of the best battle for the Aqua Crown! From the mystical Shadalar Gardens to the treacherous waves of Poseidons Horn, every match is a test of speed, precision, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AquaBall League exposes our audience and community, to concepts of being eco-friendly citizens, promoting conservation, and creativity. In between matches, players embark on quests to clean up arenas, solve oceanic mysteries, and build new technology to protect marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, are you ready to dive in, make history, and become an AquaBall legend? The next Ocean Bowl is calling will you answer?  You got next!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAX EAST 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We travelled to Boston to share the journey with our Fandom Demo version.  Check out the highlights and feedback:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To our Wishlist:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545360/extras/38d427fca973a6811d08203c76fdc145.avif?t=1782347290\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "The Aquaball League is a fast-paced 2v2 water sport and adventurous multiplayer platformer, where players use the natural abilities of marine champions—dolphin flips, squid ink defense, and octopus tentacle passes—to score big!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545360/eddf0bebc4566714545782b47caaf4e1afc95f01/header.jpg?t=1782347290", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545360/9ff23eb7db34b0d8ed7b35d82a4c77e23438012b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782347290", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545360/9ff23eb7db34b0d8ed7b35d82a4c77e23438012b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782347290", "website": "http://oceanbowlegaming.createmindset.com/game-showcase/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows OS 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6th gen / AMD FX 8XXX<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows OS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 8th gen / Ryzen 7 1st gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 